---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Available Resources | FIRST® Alumni & Mentors Network at Michigan">
    <div class="container">
        <main class="content">
            <h1>Resources for Teams</h1>
            <p class="text-par">
                Are you a <i>FIRST<sup>&reg;</sup></i> team looking for resources or support?
                You've come to the right place! FAMNM is here to help you
                by connecting you to U of M students, events, and external resources.
                As our member base is primarily comprised of FIRST alumni,
                we do our best to provide the next generation of FIRST
                students the best experience possible and grow our extensive
                FIRST FAMNMily!
            </p>
            <p class="text-par" style="margin-bottom: 1.5em;">
                FAMNM is not intended to place mentors with individual teams.
                Our members are full-time students with their own coursework and commitments,
                so we are not able to act as a mentor matching service. What we can do is
                partner with your team on workshops, events, outreach, and other projects
                that fit both of our goals. If that sounds like a good fit, we would love to
                hear from you. To start that conversation, reach out to our Director of Project Development at
                <a href="mailto:famnm.projects@umich.edu">famnm.projects@umich.edu</a>.
            </p>
        </main>
    </div>
    <!-- /.container -->
</BaseLayout>
